::PC_U03_L01_Q_Q01::
Question ID: PC_U03_L01_Q_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.TR.13
Question:
For y=2 sin((2π/2)x), which feature should be identified when interpreting the graph
{
~B. Amplitude 4 and period 2π#This changes at least one graph feature and does not match the stated function or model.
~C. Amplitude 2π and no period#This choice reflects a common misconception or an incomplete step.
~D. A vertical asymptote at x=2#This choice does not match the conditions in the question.
=A. Amplitude 2 and period 2#Correct. This answer follows the lesson concept and connects the result to the stated standard.
}

